qiangli/yamux

This is a Go port of libp2p/rust-yamux (https://github.com/libp2p/rust-yamux),
which is dual-licensed under Apache-2.0 OR MIT. Ported from upstream commit
6610cff7b3fe81aeb4fda9fa96d7ac4b3b2dbaf8. The upstream copyright and license
notices are retained in LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE.

No source code from hashicorp/yamux or libp2p/go-yamux (both MPL-2.0) is
included. Their public Go APIs (type, function and method names and signatures)
are matched so this module can be used as a drop-in replacement; the
implementation is ported from rust-yamux and written fresh.

Any file copied from the Go standard library keeps its BSD-3-Clause header and
the Go Authors' notice.
